s:**\n  - 5 \u00d7 USB-C Dock DK-200 (new, not refurbished) at $189 each = $945\n  - 5 \u00d7 32-inch 5K Monitor MN-32 (new) at $529 each = $2,645\n- **Total:** $3,590\n- **Ship to:** HQ\n- **Vendor:** primary\n\nI used DK-200 rather than the DK-210 successor because DK-200 was in stock. Because the total is over $2,500, the order was routed for manager approval, and the approver marked it \"Approved.\" I entered \"HQ\" as the ship-to because that's the only location I have; if the order needs a specific street address or room, it should be checked.", "type": "text"}]}]}